hadiths[60]{hadithnumber,text}:
"20","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah ne meri ummat se us cheez ko muaf farmaya hai jo un ke dilon mein khayal aae, jab tak woh use karen nahin ya kahen nahin.'"
"21","[AI-translation] Zurarah bin Abi Aufa ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se isi ki misl riwayat ki aur use marfoo'an bayan nahin kiya."
"22","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah ne meri ummat se us cheez ko muaf farmaya hai jo un ke dilon mein khayal aae, jab tak woh use karen nahin ya kahen nahin.'"
"23","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Tum jannat mein dakhil nahin hoge yahan tak ke iman lao, aur iman nahin laoge yahan tak ke aapas mein muhabbat karo. Kya main tumhen aisi cheez na bataun ke jab tum use karo to aapas mein muhabbat karne lago?' Unhon ne kaha: Woh kya hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: 'Aapas mein salam ko aam karo.'"
"24","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jis mein amanat nahin us mein iman nahin.'"
"25","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah aur Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se marfoo'an riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Zani jab zina karta hai to momin hote hue zina nahin karta, chor jab chori karta hai to momin hote hue chori nahin karta, sharabi jab sharab peeta hai to momin hote hue nahin peeta, khiyanat karne wala jab khiyanat karta hai to momin hote hue khiyanat nahin karta, aur koi shakhs loot maar nahin karta jabke logon ki nazren us ki taraf uthi hon aur woh momin ho.' Ibn Tawus ne kaha: Aur mere walid ne kaha: Jab woh yeh kare to us se iman nikal jata hai. Unhon ne kaha: Iman sae ki tarah hai ya isi jaisi cheez."
"26","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Dono aankhen zina karti hain, dono paon zina karte hain, aur sharmgah is ki tasdeeq karti hai ya takzeeb karti hai.'"
"27","[AI-translation] Hammad bin Salamah ne isi sanad se yeh hadees isi ki misl riwayat ki, aur unhon ne dono paon ki jagah dono hathon ka zikr kiya."
"28","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Meri ummat mein se sattar hazar baghair hisab ke jannat mein dakhil honge.' To Ukashah bin Mihsan ne kaha: Allah se dua karen ke woh mujhe un mein se bana de. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aey Allah! Use un mein se bana de.' Phir ek aur shakhs ne kaha: Allah se dua karen ke woh mujhe un mein se bana de. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ukashah tum se is mein sabqat le gaya.'"
"29","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya, phir unhon ne isi ki misl zikr ki."
"30","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Musa (Alaihissalam) ki Adam (Alaihissalam) se mulaqat hui, to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum wohi Adam ho jinhen Allah ne apne hath se paida kiya, aur apne farishton se tumhen sajda karaya, aur tumhen apni jannat mein thahraya, phir tum ne apni aulad ko jannat se nikalwa diya? Unhon (Adam) ne un se kaha: Aey Musa! Kya tum wohi ho jinhen Allah ne apni risalaton se muntakhab farmaya aur tum se kalam farmaya? To main pahle paida hua ya taqdeer (ka likha)? Unhon (Musa) ne kaha: Nahin, balke taqdeer. To Adam (Alaihissalam) Musa (Alaihissalam) par ghalib aae.'"
"31","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah aur Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne sahaba ke darmiyan baithe hote, to ajnabi aata aur Aap ko pahchanta nahin aur na janta ke Aap kahan hain yahan tak ke poochta. To ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Agar ham Aap ke liye ek majlis bana den phir Aap us mein baithen taake ajnabi Aap ko pahchan le. To ham ne Aap ke liye mitti ka ek chabutra bana diya aur ham Aap ke dono pahluon mein baithe hote. Ham baithe the aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni majlis mein aa rahe the ke achanak ek aadmi aaya jo logon mein sab se husn chehra, sab se khushbu wali bu aur sab se saaf kapde wala tha, goya us ke kapdon ko mail ne chhua hi na tha, yahan tak ke us ne saf ke kinare se salam kiya aur kaha: Assalamu alaikum Ya Muhammad. To Aap ne us ke salam ka jawab diya. Phir us ne kaha: Kya main qareeb aaun? Woh bar bar kahta raha: Kya main qareeb aaun? Aur Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate rahe: 'Qareeb aao,' yahan tak ke us ne apna hath Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke dono ghutnon par rakh diya, phir kaha: Aey Muhammad, Islam kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum Allah ki ibadat karo, Us ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karo, namaz qaim karo, zakat do, Ramazan ke roze rakho aur Baitullah ka hajj karo.' Us ne kaha: Jab main yeh kar lun to kya main Musalman ho gaya? Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.' To us ne kaha: Tum ne sach kaha. Rawi ne kaha: Ham ne us ke 'tum ne sach kaha' kahne ko na-pasand kiya. Us ne kaha: Aey Muhammad, mujhe Allah par, farishton par, kitab par, nabiyon par aur poori taqdeer par iman ke bare mein batao? Us ne kaha: Aey Muhammad, mujhe ihsan ke bare mein batao? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum Allah ki ibadat karo goya tum Use dekh rahe ho, phir agar tum Use nahin dekhte to beshak Woh tumhen dekhta hai.' Us ne kaha: Tum ne sach kaha. Us ne kaha: Aey Muhammad, mujhe Qayamat ke bare mein batao? To Aap ne sar jhuka liya aur use jawab na diya, phir us ne dohraya to jawab na diya, phir us ne dohraya to jawab na diya, phir Aap ne sar uthaya aur Allah ki qasam kha kar farmaya ke is ke bare mein siwae Allah ke koi nahin janta: Beshak Qayamat ka ilm Allah ke paas hai, aur Wohi barish nazil farmata hai. Phir woh aadmi chala gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use wapas lao, use talash karo,' lekin unhon ne use na paya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh Jibreel the, logon ko un ka deen sikhane aae the.'"
"32","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon ke samne tashreef farma the ke achanak ek aadmi chalte hue aaya aur kaha: Aey Muhammad, iman kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum Allah par, Us ke farishton par, Us ke rasoolon par, Us se mulaqat par iman lao, aur aakhirat ke uthae jane par iman lao.' Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Islam kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum Us ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karo, farz namaz qaim karo, farz zakat ada karo aur Ramazan ke roze rakho.' Us ne kaha: Aey Muhammad, ihsan kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum Allah ki ibadat karo goya tum Use dekh rahe ho, phir agar tum Use nahin dekhte to beshak Woh tumhen dekhta hai.' Us ne kaha: Aey Muhammad, Qayamat kab aaegi? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Jis se poocha gaya hai woh poochne wale se ziyada nahin janta, aur main tumhen us ki alamaton ke bare mein bataunga: jab aurat apni aaqa ko janam de, aur tum nange paon walon ko logon ke sardar dekho. Aur paanch cheezon ke bare mein siwae Allah ke koi nahin janta: «إِنَّ اللَّهَ عِنْدَهُ عِلْمُ السَّاعَةِ وَيُنَزِّلُ الْغَيْثَ» [31-Luqman:34].' Phir woh aadmi chala gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use wapas lao, use talash karo,' lekin unhon ne use na paya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh Jibreel the, logon ko un ka deen sikhane aae the.'"
"33","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba se farmaya: 'Mujh se poocho.' To woh Aap se poochne se dare, phir ek aadmi aaya yahan tak ke us ne apne dono hath Aap ke ghutnon par rakhe aur kaha: Aey Muhammad, mujhe iman ke bare mein batao. To rawi ne isi ki misl zikr ki aur izafa kiya: 'Aur uthae jane par aur poori taqdeer par iman lae.' Aur har sawal par kahta: Tum ne sach kaha. Aur Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum nange paon, nange badan, behre aur goonge logon ko zameen ke badshah dekho, aur maweshiyon ke charwahon ko imaraton mein ek doosre se uncha banate dekho.' Aur us mein kaha: 'Tum Allah se daro goya tum Use dekh rahe ho.' Aur hadees mein kaha: 'Yeh Jibreel hain.' Abu Zur'ah ne kaha: Un ka irada tha ke tum jano ke un se poocho."
"34","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Qayamat qaim nahin hogi yahan tak ke suraj apne ghurub hone ki jagah se tulu' ho. Phir jab aisa hoga to jo us par hain sab iman le aaenge. To wohi waqt hai «لَا يَنْفَعُ نَفْسًا إِيمَانُهَا لَمْ تَكُنْ آمَنَتْ مِنْ قَبْلُ أَوْ كَسَبَتْ فِي إِيمَانِهَا خَيْرًا» [6-Al-An'am:158].'"
"35","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya (is ayat ki tafseer mein): «مَنْ جَاءَ بِالْحَسَنَةِ فَلَهُ خَيْرٌ مِنْهَا وَهُمْ مِنْ فَزَعٍ يَوْمَئِذٍ آمِنُونَ» [27-An-Naml:89]. Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh «لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ» hai.' «وَمَنْ جَاءَ بِالسَّيِّئَةِ فَكُبَّتْ وُجُوهُهُمْ فِي النَّارِ» [27-An-Naml:90]: 'Aur yeh shirk hai.'"
"36","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Teen qism ke log hain jin se Allah kalam nahin farmaega, aur na Qayamat ke din un ki taraf (rahmat se) dekhega aur na unhen pak karega, aur un ke liye dardnak azab hai: budha zani, jhoota badshah, aur mutakabbir faqeer.'"
"37","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne chacha se farmaya: '«لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ» kaho taake main Qayamat ke din tumhare haq mein is se gawahi dun.' To unhon ne kaha: Agar Quraish mujhe ta'na na den to main is se tumhari aankh thandi kar deta. To Allah Azza wa Jalla ne nazil farmaya: «إِنَّكَ لَا تَهْدِي مَنْ أَحْبَبْتَ وَلَكِنَّ اللَّهَ يَهْدِي مَنْ يَشَاءُ وَهُوَ أَعْلَمُ بِالْمُهْتَدِينَ» [28-Al-Qasas:56]."
"38","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Teen cheezen jab nikal aaengi to kisi jaan ko us ka iman nafa nahin dega jo pahle iman nahin lai thi ya apne iman mein bhalai nahin kamai thi: Dajjal, Dabba, aur suraj ka apne maghrib se tulu' hona.'"
"39","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab yeh ayat nazil hui «وَأَنْذِرْ عَشِيرَتَكَ الْأَقْرَبِينَ» [26-Ash-Shu'ara:214], to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Quraish ko bulaya aur unhen jama kiya, aam aur khas: 'Aey Bani Ka'b bin Lu'ay! Apne nafs ko jahannam ki aag se bachao. Aey Bani Murrah bin Ka'b! Apne nafs ko jahannam ki aag se bachao. Aey Bani Abd Shams! Apne nafs ko jahannam ki aag se bachao. Aey Bani Abd Manaf! Apne nafs ko jahannam ki aag se bachao. Aey Fatimah! Apne nafs ko jahannam ki aag se bachao. Aur beshak main Allah ke samne tumhare liye kisi cheez ka malik nahin siwae is ke ke tumhara rishtedari ka rishta hai jise main tari se jorunga.'"
"40","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo neki ka irada kare phir use na kare to us ke liye ek neki likhi jati hai; phir agar use kare to das likhi jati hain. Aur jo burai ka irada kare phir use na kare to us par kuch nahin likha jata; phir agar use kare to ek burai likhi jati hai.'"
"41","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo iman ki mithas pana chahe to use chahiye ke kisi bande se muhabbat kare jo sirf Allah ke liye ho.'"
"42","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jis ne iman ka zaeqa pana pasand kiya to woh kisi shakhs se muhabbat kare jo sirf Allah ke liye ho."
"43","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Dono aankhon ka zina dekhna hai, zaban ka zina bolna hai, hath ka zina pakadna hai, pet ka zina, aur paon ka zina chalna hai. Aur sharmgah jo ho chuka us ki tasdeeq karti hai ya takzeeb karti hai.'"
"44","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Madina ke khajooron ke bagh mein chal raha tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aey Abu Hurairah! Kasrat mal wale halak ho gae siwae us ke jo aise aur aise aur aise kahe' — apne samne, apne dayen aur apne baen. Phir thodi dair chale, to farmaya: 'Aey Abu Hurairah! Kya main tumhen jannat ke khazanon mein se ek khazana na bataun? Kaho «لَا حَوْلَ وَلَا قُوَّةَ وَلَا مَلْجَأَ مِنَ اللَّهِ إِلَّا إِلَيْهِ».' Phir thodi dair chale, to farmaya: 'Aey Abu Hurairah! Kya tum jante ho logon par Allah ka haq kya hai aur Allah par logon ka haq kya hai? Logon par Allah ka haq yeh hai ke woh Us ki ibadat karen aur Us ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karen, aur Allah par logon ka haq jab woh aisa karen yeh hai ke woh unhen azab na de.'"
"45","[AI-translation] Kumail bin Ziyad (Rahimahullah) se Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"46","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Log tum se har cheez ke bare mein poochenge yahan tak ke kahenge: Yeh Allah hai jis ne har cheez ko paida kiya, to use kis ne paida kiya?' Ja'far ne kaha: To mere bhai ne mujh se Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Goya unhon ne use marfoo'an bayan kiya, Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum se poocha jae to kaho: Allah har cheez se pahle tha, Wohi har cheez ka khaliq hai, aur Wohi har cheez ke baad hai.'"
"47","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Allah ke paas teen cheezon ke sath aae Allah use jannat mein dakhil farmayega: woh Allah wahdahu ki ibadat kare aur Us ke sath shareek na kare, aur sune aur ita'at kare.'"
"48","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Tumhare Rabb ne tumhen shafa'at ke bare mein kya jawab diya? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Jaanat ke darwaze par un ka toot padna mere nazdeek us se ziyada ahm hai. Aur meri shafa'at us ke liye hai jo ikhlas se gawahi de ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, us ki zaban us ke dil ki tasdeeq kare aur us ka dil us ki zaban ki tasdeeq kare.'"
"49","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Arab ke kahe hue sab se sache shair mein se hai: Khabardar, Allah ke siwa har cheez batil hai.'"
"50","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Arab ke kahe hue sab se sachi baat Labeed ka qaul hai: Khabardar, Allah ke siwa har cheez batil hai. Aur qareeb tha ke Umayyah bin Abis Salt Musalman ho jata."
"51","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya, main ne kaha: 'Jahiliyyat ke kamon mein se nauha hai, aadmi ka apne bete se alag hona, aur logon par us ka fakhr karna.'"
"52","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Teen cheezen munafiq ke kamon mein se hain, agarche woh roza rakhe aur namaz padhe aur da'wa kare ke woh Musalman hai: jab bole jhoot bole, jab wa'da kare khilaf kare, aur jab amanat di jae khiyanat kare.'"
"53","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Qayamat us shakhs par qaim nahin hogi jo «لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ» kahta hai, ya neki ka hukm deta hai, ya burai se rokta hai.'"
"54","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Teen cheezen jis mein hon woh un se iman ki mithas paega: Allah aur Us ke Rasool us ke nazdeek un ke siwa har cheez se ziyada mahboob hon, woh kisi shakhs se muhabbat kare to sirf Allah ke liye muhabbat kare, aur kufr ki taraf lautne ko napasand kare baad is ke ke Allah ne use Islam ki hidayat di hai jaise woh aag mein dale jane ko napasand karta hai."
"55","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se marfoo'an riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Allah ne har bid'ati se tauba ko rok rakha hai.'"
"56","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Zaroor jannat mein dakhil honge siwae us ke jis ne inkar kiya.'"
"57","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Islam ajnabi haalat mein shuru hua, aur jald waisa hi ajnabi ho jaega jaisa shuru hua tha.'"
"58","[AI-translation] Abu Ja'far se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke qaul: 'Zani jab zina karta hai to momin hote hue zina nahin karta, aur chor jab chori karta hai to momin hote hue chori nahin karta' ke bare mein poocha gaya. To Abu Ja'far ne kaha: Yeh Islam hai — aur unhon ne ek bada daira banaya; aur yeh iman hai — aur unhon ne bade daire ke darmiyan ek chhota daira banaya. Unhon ne kaha: Iman Islam mein mahsoor hai. Phir jab woh zina aur chori kare to iman se nikal kar Islam mein aa jata hai, aur use Islam se sirf Allah Azza wa Jalla ka kufr nikalta hai."
"59","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mahina se mahina tak kaffara hai' — yani: Ramazan se Ramazan tak, Juma se Juma tak kaffara hai, aur farz namaz se us ke baad wali farz namaz tak kaffara hai. Phir us ke baad Aap ne farmaya: 'Siwae teen se: Allah ke sath shirk, bai'at todna, aur sunnat chhorna.' Rawi ne kaha: To ham ne jana ke yeh ek nai baat se hai, to ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Raha Allah ke sath shirk to ham ne use jan liya, bai'at todna aur sunnat chhorna kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Bai'at todna yeh hai ke tum kisi aadmi se bai'at karo phir use apne dayen hath ka muamla do, phir us par palat kar use apni talwar se qatl karo. Aur raha sunnat chhorna to jama'at se nikal jana hai.'"
"60","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Batao zani, chor aur sharabi ke bare mein tumhara kya khayal hai? To unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool ziyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh fahisha hain aur in mein saza hai.' Phir Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya main tumhen sab se bade kabira gunahon ke bare mein na bataun?' Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool ziyada jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah ke sath shirk, walidain ki nafarmani, jhooti baat, Musalman ka qatl, aur pakdaman aurat par tohmat.'"
"61","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab do aadmi Islam mein Allah ke liye aapas mein muhabbat karen phir woh darmiyan bigad jae to yeh sirf us gunah se hota hai jo un mein se ek karta hai.'"
"62","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab Allah ne makhlooq ko paida farmaya to ek kitab likhi, aur use apne paas arsh ke upar rakha. Us mein likha tha, beshak meri rahmat mere ghazab par ghalib hai.'"
"63","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Na adwa hai, na teera hai aur main naik faal ko pasand karta hun.'"
"64","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap se poocha gaya: Kaun sa Islam afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh jis ki zaban aur hath se Musalman mahfooz rahen.'"
"65","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Do aadmi aapas mein gali galoch karne lage, to un mein se ek ne doosre ko us ki maan ka ta'na diya. To yeh baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahunchi, to Aap ne us aadmi ko bulaya aur farmaya: 'Kya tum ne use us ki maan ka ta'na diya?' Aap ne is ko kayi martaba dohraya. To us aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, jo main ne kaha us par Allah se bakhshish mangen. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Apna sar uthao aur is majma ki taraf dekho.' To us ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ird gird logon ko dekha to Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum un mein se surkh ya siyah kisi se afzal nahin siwae us ke jise deen mein fazeelat hasil ho.'"
"66","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai — Yahya ne kaha: Mera khayal hai Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se — Aap ne farmaya: '«مَنْ جَاءَ بِالْحَسَنَةِ فَلَهُ خَيْرٌ مِنْهَا وَهُمْ مِنْ فَزَعٍ يَوْمَئِذٍ آمِنُونَ» [27-An-Naml:89].' Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh «لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ» hai.' «وَمَنْ جَاءَ بِالسَّيِّئَةِ فَكُبَّتْ وُجُوهُهُمْ فِي النَّارِ» [27-An-Naml:90]: 'Aur yeh shirk hai.'"
"67","[AI-translation] Sa'sa'ah bin Sauhan ne Ibn Yazid se kaha: Main tumhare walid ko tum se ziyada mahboob tha, aur tum mujhe mere bete se ziyada mahboob ho. Do khaslaten hain jin ki main tumhen waseeyat karta hun, to unhen mujh se yaad rakho, mominon se khalis dosti rakho aur fajir se husn ikhlaq se pesh aao kyunke fajir tum se husn ikhlaq par raazi ho jaega, aur beshak ham par lazim hai ke momin se khalis dosti rakhen."
"68","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se waswase ki shikayat ki jo woh pate the. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham aisi baat dil mein late hain ke ham mein se kisi ka aasman se girna use is baat ke kahne se ziyada mahboob hai. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yahi khalis iman hai.'"
"69","[AI-translation] Hazrat Qutailah bint Saifi Juhaniyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ahbar mein se ek hibr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Tum ummat Muhammad kitne achche log ho, agar tum shirk na karte? To unhon ne kaha: Woh kya hai? Us ne kaha: Tum kahte ho: Ka'ba ki qasam. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mohlat di, phir farmaya: 'Jab tum qasam khao to kaho: Rabb Ka'ba ki qasam.' Phir us ne kaha: Tum kitne achche log ho agar tum Allah ka shareek na banate. Unhon ne kaha: Woh kya hai? Us ne kaha: Tum kahte ho jo Allah chahe aur tum chaho. Qutailah ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kuch mohlat di phir farmaya: 'Tum mein se jo kahe jo Allah chahe to use chahiye ke kahe phir tum chaho.'"
"70","[AI-translation] Hazrat Qutailah bint Saifi se riwayat hai — aur woh muhajirat mein se thin — unhon ne kaha: Ek hibr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya, phir rawi ne isi ki misl zikr ki, aur izafa kiya: Donon qaulon par kaha: 'SubhanAllah, SubhanAllah, woh kya hai?' Aur Aap ne farmaya: 'Aur jo kahe jo Allah chahe to use chahiye ke donon ke darmiyan kahe phir tum chaho.'"
"71","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Yasar Juhani se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamari qabeela ki ek aurat ne mujhe bataya ke us ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete suna, aur Aap farma rahe the: 'Tum mein se koi na kahe: Agar Allah aur falan na hote. Phir agar use zaroor kahna ho to use chahiye ke kahe: Aur agar Allah na hote phir falan.'"
"72","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne ek aadmi ko kahte suna: Burai taqdeer se nahin hai. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Hamare aur ahl qadar ke darmiyan Allah Ta'ala ka qaul hai: «سَيَقُولُ الَّذِينَ أَشْرَكُوا لَوْ شَاءَ اللَّهُ مَا أَشْرَكْنَا وَلَا آبَاؤُنَا» — unhon ne Us ke qaul «فَلَوْ شَاءَ لَهَدَاكُمْ أَجْمَعِينَ» tak tilawat ki. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Aajzi aur danai taqdeer se hain."
"73","[AI-translation] Ibn Tawus ne kaha: Taqdeer ke bare mein bolne wale baghair ilm ke bolte hain. Taqdeer ke bare mein kalam — unhon ne kaha: Iblees ki Isa bin Maryam (Alaihissalam) se mulaqat hui, to us ne un se kaha: Kya tum nahin jante ke tumhen siwae us ke kuch nahin pahunchega jo tum par muqaddar kiya gaya hai, pahad ki choti par chadho phir wahan se gir jao, phir dekho tum zinda rahte ho ya nahin? To Isa ne kaha: 'Beshak Allah farmata hai: Beshak bande ko munasib nahin ke woh mujhe aazmae; aur jo main chahun karta hun.'"
"74","[AI-translation] Zuhri ne kaha: Iblees ki Isa bin Maryam se mulaqat hui, phir unhon ne isi ki misl zikr ki, aur kaha: Isa ne us se kaha: Beshak banda apne Rabb ko nahin aazmata, lekin Allah apne bande ko aazmata hai. To unhon (Isa) ne use daleel mein hara diya."
"75","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mu'az ko Yaman ki taraf bheja, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Beshak tum Ahle Kitab qaum ke paas ja rahe ho, to unhen gawahi dene ki da'wat do ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin. Phir agar woh is ke liye tumhari baat qabool karen, to unhen batao ke Allah ne un ke malon mein sadaqa farz kiya hai, jo un ke aghniya se liya jaega, phir un ke fuqara mein wapas kiya jaega. Phir agar woh is ke liye tumhari baat qabool karen, to un ke umda malon se bacho, aur mazloom ki dua se bacho, kyunke beshak us ke aur Allah ke darmiyan koi hijab nahin."
"76","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se kaha gaya: Hamare paas ek aadmi aaya hai, woh taqdeer ke bare mein bolta hai. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Use mujhe dikhao, main us ka sar pakdunga. Allah ki qasam! Agar us ki gardan mere hath mein aa gai to main use zaroor todunga, aur agar us ki naak mere munh mein aa gai to main use zaroor katunga. Kyunke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Goya main Bani Fahm ki auraton ko Khazraj ke sath tawaf karte dekh raha hun, yahan tak ke woh Allah ko khair muqaddar karne se nikal denge, jaise unhon ne Use shar muqaddar karne se nikal diya hai.'"
"77","[AI-translation] Mujahid bin Jabr (Rahimahullah) se Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"78","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mujhe paanch cheezen di gayin jo mujh se pahle kisi nabi ko nahin di gayin, aur main fakhr nahin karta, mujhe surkh o siyah ki taraf bheja gaya, aur mujh se pahle nabi sirf apni qaum ki taraf khas bheja jata tha, aur mujhe tamam logon ki taraf aam bheja gaya; aur rob se meri madad ki gayi, to woh mere aage ek mahine ki musafat hai; aur mere liye zameen ko masjid aur tahoor banaya gaya; aur mere liye ghanimaten halal ki gayin, aur mujh se pahle kisi ke liye halal nahin thin; aur mujhe shafa'at di gayi to main ne use apni ummat ke liye zakheera kar rakha hai, to woh us ko pahunchegi jo Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek nahin karta.'"
"79","[AI-translation] Ubaid bin Umair se Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) se isi ki manind riwayat hai. Rawi ne kaha: Aur Mujahid kahta tha: Surkh o siyah se murad jinn aur ins hain."
